  "details": "It has gotten really really confusing for both new and old users to use the menus, now that there are so many new options added.\n\nI know many users would not like this, but the menu options have changed so much, that I believe a complete overhaul of both the small and large menus to optimize the new options is necessary.  \n\nThe menu UI itself doesn't have to change drastically, but the options are not optimally placed anymore.  Changing the options around will help a lot.\n\nOnce people find it easier to use, they will soon forget about being mad about the changes and be happy that it works better now.",
